    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like \"being still.\" it feels like being a ghost. i look in the mirror and i don't recognize the person looking back. everything i did for two decades was for them. without that, there's no point to any of it. it's like i'm just waiting for the rest of me to disappear too.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
